WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.610
Some people say that killing
the innocent is always wrong,

2
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.850
in every time and place.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.140
Others say that right and
wrong depend on the situation,

4
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.500
the culture or the outcome.

5
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.870
Now a friend asks you to
lie to cover for them.

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:15.860
What now?

7
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.660
Should you follow the
rule, count the results,

8
00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:21.300
or ask what a good person would do?

9
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.300
In this mission, you'll
meet three ways of deciding,

10
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.510
each asking its own question.

11
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.810
Then you'll place the theories on a line,

12
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.920
from fixed rules to it depends.

13
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:37.280
Your mission: find out how the rule, the
result and the good person each settle

14
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.270
what is right.
